   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Load Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "The same fixed Enron training, validation, and test splits used in\n",
    "the Logistic Regression baseline are used here.\n",
    "\n",
    "Using identical splits ensures that differences in performance\n",
    "are attributable to the model rather than differences in the data."
   ]
  },
