    "## 9. Observations\n",
    "\n",
    "The TF-IDF + Linear SVM model achieved strong performance on the\n",
    "held-out Enron test set, obtaining an F1-score of approximately\n",
    "99.02%.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model achieved high precision and recall for the phishing/spam\n",
    "class, resulting in a small number of false negatives.\n",
    "\n",
    "The validation and test results were closely aligned, indicating\n",
    "consistent in-domain performance on the Enron dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "The Linear SVM provides a strong traditional machine-learning\n",
    "baseline for comparison with the Logistic Regression and subsequent\n",
    "BiLSTM models.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, these results represent in-domain performance only.\n",
    "Cross-dataset generalisation to the unseen CEAS-08 dataset will be\n",
    "evaluated separately."
